    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} fires one of the following magical rays, chosen at random, at a target it can see within 90 feet of itself (roll [[/r 1d4]]; reroll if it has already used that ray this turn):</p><p><strong>1: Confusion Ray.</strong> <em>Wisdom Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=GCcRcrkDw0E5tLXk]]. <em>Failure:</em> [[/damage average activity=GCcRcrkDw0E5tLXk]] damage, and the target can’t take Reactions until the end of its next turn. On its next turn, the target can’t move, and it uses its action to make a melee or ranged attack against a randomly determined creature within range. If the target can’t attack, it does nothing on that turn.</p><p><strong>2: Paralyzing Ray.</strong> <em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=sqdDkEcKtDbQ4DEy]]. <em>Failure:</em> The target has the &amp;Reference[Paralyzed apply=false] condition and repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. After 1 minute, it succeeds automatically.</p><p><strong>3: Fear Ray.</strong> <em>Wisdom Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=8ytYHrXluTAn1ITf]]. <em>Failure:</em> [[/damage average activity=8ytYHrXluTAn1ITf]] damage, and the target has the &amp;Reference[Frightened apply=false] condition until the end of its next turn.</p><p><strong>4: Wounding Ray.</strong> <em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=bEQug4FnKJVY42tY]]. <em>Failure:</em> [[/damage average activity=bEQug4FnKJVY42tY]] damage. <em>Success:</em> Half damage.</p>",
